set.body:
Implement the canonical linear-quadratic rewrite:
||T theta||_G^2 -> <theta, T* G T theta>.

Families:
- ordinary ridge with explicit coefficient geometry;
- generalized Tikhonov terms;
- graph, derivative, spline, and block smoothness through typed linear targets;
- objective-ridge versus denominator-loading forms kept distinct.

Lowering records the original term, pulled-back operator, evidence changes, and exact equivalence proof.

Acceptance:
- analytic and direct dense differential oracles;
- graph Laplacian identities and null-space tests;
- objective-ridge and denominator-loading are observably distinct;
- sparse/matrix-free T does not densify;
- JVM/JS and IR round-trip green.
